{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28521","headline":"题吴兴消暑楼十二韵 · 杜牧","name":"题吴兴消暑楼十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晴日登攀好，危楼物象饶。\n一溪通四境，万岫饶层霄。\n鸟翼舒华屋，鱼鳞棹短桡。\n浪花机乍织，云叶匠新雕。\n台榭罗嘉卉，城池敞丽谯。\n蟾蜍来作监，螮蝀引成桥。\n燕任随秋叶，人空集早潮。\n楚鸿行尽直，沙鹭立偏翘。\n暮角凄游旅，清歌惨泬寥。\n景牵游目困，愁托酒肠销。\n远吹流松韵，残阳渡柳桥。\n时陪庾公赏，还悟脱烦嚣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28521.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28521","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}